# Security

- Follow `docs/SECURITY.md` (threat model + OWASP 2025 controls). Validate every input with the shared schema; parameterized queries only.
- Rate-limit {{auth, OTP, search, AI, uploads}}; verify webhooks by signature; secrets only from server env.
- Log security events without personal data.

## Never
- Trust client input
- service keys in client bundles
- eval or dangerouslySetInnerHTML with user data
